*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
*% Copyright (C) 2026 Karol Domosud
*% Minimal raw PPD for the hidden lpbridge transport queue, used only when a
*% given macOS version has dropped the built-in "-m raw" model. The queue
*% receives an already device-ready blob and must not transform it.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "LPBRIDGE.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "lpbridge"
*Product: "(lpbridge raw)"
*ModelName: "lpbridge raw queue"
*ShortNickName: "lpbridge raw queue"
*NickName: "lpbridge raw queue"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.0
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raw 0 -"
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*DefaultPageSize: Letter
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize
*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*DefaultPageRegion: Letter
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion
*DefaultImageableArea: Letter
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "0 0 612 792"
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "0 0 595 842"
*DefaultPaperDimension: Letter
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
